  "description": "***\"Revenge? I just thought you were - fucking attractive.\"** \n\n\"Do you think Jae-kyung is feeling it?\"* \n\nA snickering laughter flies in like a dagger and pierces the room. I lose consciousness, and when I open my eyes again, I find myself in an unfamiliar, pure white room. In a mysterious space where I was kidnapped along with my high school classmates whom I wasn't even that close with, the 'escape room game' prepared by the criminal begins.\n\n*\"In an escape room game, you have to make the same picture as the picture, right? You did that, right?\"\n\".......\"\n\"No?\"*\n\nThere are two choices. Die? Rape Kim Jae-Kyung. The kidnapper is clearly sexually obsessed.You pervert.\n\nCollect! Let's play :)\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
